# Purpose
Explains how to write follow-up actions with outcomes, owners, due dates, and
useful context.

# Key Sections
- When to use this guide.
- Write actions as outcomes.
- Include an owner.
- Include a due date when timing matters.
- Add context without copying everything.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Do not assign owners or due dates unless they are supplied by the user or the
  source material.

